        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Keep the stock hot throughout cooking. Adding cold stock shocks the rice and stops the cooking. The final 'mantecatura' -- beating in butter and cheese off the heat -- is what makes risotto creamy."
          }
        ]
      },
